      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "This Galleria handbag from PRADA's Fall 2026 collection is crafted from elephant-grey calfskin, with a clean trapezoidal silhouette in a mini size that's both compact and refined. The standout feature is the perforated and stitched edging that creates a sculptural, dimensional finish, adding a touch of artisanal flair.",
