      "type": "heading",
      "text": "· Edge-Stitching Craft ·",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "As PRADA's quintessential It bag, the Galleria welcomes new iterations each season. This season, the focus is on 'edge-stitching,' lending the bag a refined, handcrafted feel.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "caption",
      "text": "Prada Galleria campaign (swipe left/right for more)",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "caption",
      "text": "(Swipe left/right for more images)",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "At the Scandicci workshop in Florence, artisans spend over six hours crafting a single Galleria handbag, which is assembled from 83 individual components — a testament to industrial precision and exquisite craftsmanship.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
