      "type": "caption",
      "text": "The making of the Galleria",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The new version is entirely covered in elephant-grey calfskin, showcasing natural fine wrinkles that feel organic and breathable.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "text": null,
      "url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/wtprgy0/74022421956b391c.jpg",
      "full_url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/wtprgy0/109efa623fbb695b.jpg",
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Artisans first perforate the edges, then cut slender strips of matching calfskin to weave through as stitching — even the handles feature intricate edge-stitching, creating a raised, tactile texture.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
