    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "· Two Interchangeable Straps ·",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Killer Bag's elegant, structured double handles, complete with tabs and snap closures, exude poise and sophistication when carried by hand or on the arm — perfect for formal occasions.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "text": null,
      "url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/wtprgy0/acfa7e101b8886d1.jpg",
      "full_url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/wtprgy0/f19520666e7a21e9.jpg",
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The designer has equipped this bag with two straps, both adjustable and detachable — a slim leather strap for shoulder or crossbody wear, maintaining a minimalist elegance while freeing your hands; and a wider fabric strap embroidered with the brand logo for a more youthful vibe.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
