      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "A keychain charm is casually tied to the handle — the key ring cleverly hidden between leather tabs, with two layers of leather fringe swaying with your movements. You can detach it or leave it on for a playful touch.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
