      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "We managed to fit a phone, coin purse, notebook, compact mirror, perfume, keychain, and more essentials. The side snap closures allow the bag to expand slightly, so you can carry even more!",
      "url": null,
