    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "PRADA is a renowned Italian fashion house founded in 1913 in Milan by Mario & Martino Prada, initially specializing in handbags, luggage, and accessories. Today, it also encompasses fashion, footwear, fragrances, and more, with brands like Miu Miu, Church's, and Car Shoe under its umbrella. Since 1913, from Milan.",
